{"title":"DeepThink from DeepSeek","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/911323574/0/marginalrevolution~DeepThink-from-DeepSeek.html","date":1737383432000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/deepseek_ai/status/1881318130334814301\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSeek-R1 is here</a>.  Try it — it is amazing, free and open source.  Go to <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chat.deepseek.com/\" target=\"_blank\">the main site</a> and press “DeepThink” for superior performance.  Marginal cost remains difficult to measure, but almost certainly far cheaper than the main models.  A big day, most of all for Africa.  Some <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/teortaxestex/status/1881320996298539123?s=46&amp;t=MjnX_DXTQJUzZBI6imUASg\" target=\"_blank\">commentary</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1/blob/main/DeepSeek_R1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">the research paper</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://old.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1i5jh1u/deepseek_r1_r1_zero/\" target=\"_blank\">a Reddit thread</a>.  One version <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/deepseek_ai/status/1881318135850213834?t=W3uYxtJOAM5RTSxZrNNJbA&amp;s=08\" target=\"_blank\">you can run on a Mac</a>.  Hat tip for Nathan on some of the links.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/deepthink-from-deepseek.html\">DeepThink from DeepSeek</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/911323574/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href